1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,231
Have you ever thought about dating a vampire?

2
00:00:03,281 --> 00:00:06,343
Hollywood says cheekbones and a velvet coat.

3
00:00:06,393 --> 00:00:08,313
Folklore says a swollen corpse,

4
00:00:08,363 --> 00:00:09,468
red in the face,

5
00:00:09,518 --> 00:00:11,432
who died last Tuesday.

6
00:00:11,662 --> 00:00:13,910
Let's say you date one anyway.

7
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:14,700
Day one.

8
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:16,530
He won't come in until you invite him.

9
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,227
So old-fashioned.

10
00:00:18,277 --> 00:00:20,097
The invitation doesn't expire.

11
00:00:20,147 --> 00:00:23,031
He's in your kitchen at four a.m.

12
00:00:23,261 --> 00:00:23,931
Day two.

13
00:00:23,981 --> 00:00:25,976
Every couple photo is just you,

14
00:00:26,026 --> 00:00:27,806
and a floating rose.

15
00:00:28,036 --> 00:00:28,696
Day three.

16
00:00:28,746 --> 00:00:29,631
He doesn't eat.

17
00:00:29,681 --> 00:00:30,866
He watches you eat.

18
00:00:30,916 --> 00:00:32,333
Mostly your neck.

19
00:00:32,563 --> 00:00:33,233
Day four.

20
00:00:33,283 --> 00:00:35,024
You drop a bag of rice.

21
00:00:35,074 --> 00:00:37,079
He has to count every grain.

22
00:00:37,129 --> 00:00:38,489
At nine thousand,

23
00:00:38,539 --> 00:00:39,903
he lost his place.

24
00:00:40,133 --> 00:00:40,903
Day five.

25
00:00:40,953 --> 00:00:42,093
He stays over.

26
00:00:42,143 --> 00:00:44,588
He's brought a crate of his own soil.

27
00:00:44,819 --> 00:00:45,469
Day six.

28
00:00:45,519 --> 00:00:46,574
No picnics.

29
00:00:46,624 --> 00:00:47,439
In the book,

30
00:00:47,489 --> 00:00:49,319
Dracula went out at noon.

31
00:00:49,369 --> 00:00:52,714
A film in nineteen twenty-two changed the rules.

32
00:00:52,764 --> 00:00:55,324
Now the curtains are taped shut.

33
00:00:55,634 --> 00:00:56,329
Day seven.

34
00:00:56,379 --> 00:00:57,579
Your anniversary.

35
00:00:57,629 --> 00:00:59,205
He says you look pale.

36
00:00:59,255 --> 00:00:59,810
You do.

37
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:02,277
And there are two small marks on your neck.

38
00:01:02,426 --> 00:01:03,821
You check the mirror.

39
00:01:03,891 --> 00:01:05,161
It shows the bathroom.

40
00:01:05,211 --> 00:01:06,236
And a rose,

41
00:01:06,286 --> 00:01:08,398
floating where your hand should be.

42
00:01:08,868 --> 00:01:10,515
Happy one week.
